  "id": "occupational-rehabilitation",
  "term": "occupational rehabilitation",
  "definition": "Occupational rehabilitation is a multidisciplinary program intended to improve health and work-related functioning, such as work ability, in people on sick leave. In this packet, it refers to rehabilitation programs used for people with musculoskeletal pain or common mental disorders.",
